Title: Correction to PDCCH parameters in 5.2.2.1.4 and 5.2.2.2.4 Reason for change: After RAN5#94, the message of NR-LTE coexistence TCs is as follows. There are some mismatches between CORESET and searchSpace(Yellow highlight). Then, considering the reasons of R5-213342 and R5-220629, it is better to map CORESET#1 for CSS as shown. -Map CORESET#1 within CORESET#0 BW -No overlap with LTE PDCCH regions >Frequency Domain >Time Domain within a slot Hence, the PDCCH paramters are specified as follows. Fial settings Summary of change: Changed CORESET id from 1 to 2 for USS searchSpace Changed aggregatinLevel parameters based on CORESET#1 resources -aggregationLevel2 n0n1 -aggregationLevel8 n1n0 Added CORESET#1 definition in PDCCH-ConfigCommon (in SIB1) Added searchSpace for USS Consequences if not approved: PDCCH parameters will be inconsistent Clauses affected: 5.2.2.1.4, 5.2.2.2.4

